      "side": 1,
      "message": "Obviously, there are lots of overlaps between the native GPIO framework and IO_Expander. How much thought did you put in more unified approach (meaning extending the native GPIO framework)? If we add a whole new set of APIs, it\u0027ll impact code size.\n\nAt this point, I\u0027m not convinced this is the right direction.",
